# TTF-9.list

# TritMux Trinary Text Format

# Version: 0.1-alpha

# Encoding Model:

# 00 = low

# 01 = middle

# 10 = high

# 11 = reserved / boundary / control

#

# Rules:

# - Every symbol starts with 11 as the demarcation bit lane
# - Remaining lanes carry the symbol payload

# - All symbol payloads are fixed-width 9-lane sTrytes

# - TTF-9 is NOT UTF-8 internally

# - UTF-8 exists only as import/export bridge encoding

#

# Columns:

# symbol | category | ttf9_code | lane_pattern | notes

# ============================================================

# CONTROL / CORE

# ============================================================

space | whitespace | U0000 | 11 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 | neutral fill
tab | control | U0001 | 11 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 10 | horizontal tab
newline | control | U0002 | 11 01 01 01 01 01 01 10 01 | line feed
return | control | U0003 | 11 01 01 01 01 01 01 10 10 | carriage return

# ============================================================

# LATIN UPPERCASE

# ============================================================

A | latin_upper | U0100 | 11 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 | capital A
B | latin_upper | U0101 | 11 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 10 | capital B
C | latin_upper | U0102 | 11 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 | capital C
D | latin_upper | U0103 | 11 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 01 | capital D
