i | latin_lower | U0208 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 00 10 10 | lowercase i
j | latin_lower | U0209 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 00 00 | lowercase j
k | latin_lower | U0210 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 00 01 | lowercase k
l | latin_lower | U0211 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 00 10 | lowercase l
m | latin_lower | U0212 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 01 00 | lowercase m
n | latin_lower | U0213 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 01 01 | lowercase n
o | latin_lower | U0214 | 11 00 00 00 00 01 01 01 10 | lowercase o
