# ============================================================

# NUMBERS

# ============================================================

0 | number | U0300 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 | digit zero
1 | number | U0301 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 01 | digit one
2 | number | U0302 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 10 | digit two
3 | number | U0303 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 00 | digit three
4 | number | U0304 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 01 | digit four
5 | number | U0305 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 10 | digit five
6 | number | U0306 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 10 00 | digit six
7 | number | U0307 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 10 01 | digit seven
8 | number | U0308 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 00 10 10 | digit eight
9 | number | U0309 | 11 00 00 01 00 00 01 00 00 | digit nine

# ============================================================

