" | punctuation | U0407 | 11 01 00 01 00 01 01 00 01 | quote
` | punctuation | U0408 | 11 01 00 01 00 01 01 00 10 | backtick

@ | programming | U0410 | 11 01 10 01 01 01 10 01 10 | at

# | programming | U0411 | 11 00 10 00 10 00 10 00 10 | hash

$ | programming | U0412 | 11 01 01 10 01 01 10 01 01 | dollar
% | programming | U0413 | 11 01 00 10 01 00 10 01 00 | percent
& | programming | U0414 | 11 10 00 01 00 01 00 10 10 | ampersand
_ | programming | U0415 | 11 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 | underscore

* | programming | U0416 | 11 00 01 01 01 01 00 00 00 | dash

- | programming | U0417 | 11 10 01 01 01 01 10 10 00 | plus
  = | programming | U0418 | 11 10 00 00 00 00 10 10 00 | equals
  / | programming | U0419 | 11 00 10 01 10 01 00 00 10 | slash
  \ | programming | U0420 | 11 00 00 01 01 01 00 00 10 | backslash
  | | programming | U0421 | 11 01 10 01 10 01 10 01 10 | pipe

( | grouping | U0430 | 11 01 10 10 10 10 10 01 00 | open paren
) | grouping | U0431 | 11 01 00 00 00 00 00 01 10 | close paren
