π | math | U0508 | 11 01 01 00 01 00 01 01 10 | pi
Σ | math | U0509 | 11 10 10 00 01 00 10 10 10 | sigma
Δ | math | U0510 | 11 00 10 10 10 10 10 00 10 | delta

# ============================================================

# RESERVED FUTURE ZONES

# ============================================================

# U1000-U1999 = TUI glyphs

# U2000-U2999 = Netiv reserved syntax

# U3000-U3999 = filesystem/control/meta

# U4000-U4999 = compression/framing

# U5000-U5999 = graphical blocks

# U6000-U6999 = future multilingual expansion
